{"about_the_game":"Jack is 18 years old and enjoying his summer break. While his parents are away for the week, he has little else to do except relax by the pool and keep an eye on the bane of his existence, his ever-misbehaving twin sister Eve.<br />\r\nIt's a recipe for disaster unless Eve's best friend, the enticing and luscious Cassie, meddles in their unfinished business and coaxes them toward reconciliation. But she'll need to act fast. As their days of living under the same roof draw to a close, time is running out for Jack and Eve.<br />\r\nWith a vicious and insidious new danger lurking at their periphery, Jack will need to grow up fast if he hopes to protect his friends, his loved ones... and maybe even his own life.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou play Jack. What path will you choose?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSummer Scent is a visual novel and character-driven story that your decisions will shape.<br />\r\nThrough a combination of critical choices, you will influence the narrative and forge your own path. Your actions will have consequences, good or bad, pleasurable or nefarious, wholesome or destructive.<br />\r\nThere are eighteen different routes and several variations for you to explore.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"What did you expect?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2994790/65e3fcdbe659d0a818fadb1cfacaa43d07885622.jpg"},{"name":"One could take you seriously.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2994790/1513c8729a9fcfe5fccbc4b6db0edf84abc18526.jpg"},{"name":"Five more minutes.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2994790/b11f58ffd3e57426798a19fe877b25c1f4c9a5b0.jpg"},{"name":"I forgot to get out.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2994790/109206cc3f854c981818f6c3f7a1957d36b8d8fe.jpg"},{"name":"It's sweet and almost intoxicating.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunit